      {
        type: "application",
        title: "Your Decumulation Game Plan",
        content: `**5–10 years before retirement:**\n  [ ] Forecast your three-bucket balances at retirement age\n  [ ] Project age-73 RMDs to spot a "tax torpedo"\n  [ ] If your Trad IRA + 401(k) > **$1M**, plan **Roth conversions** now\n\n**At retirement (before age 70):**\n  [ ] Delay **Social Security to 70** if longevity good (8%/yr increase)\n  [ ] Live off taxable brokerage; let Roth grow untouched\n  [ ] **Each November**: convert IRA → Roth up to top of 12% or 22% bracket\n  [ ] Coordinate with **IRMAA** thresholds (Medicare premium cliffs)\n\n**At RMD age (73 / 75):**\n  [ ] Set up **automatic RMDs** with your custodian\n  [ ] Consider **Qualified Charitable Distributions (QCDs)** up to **$108k/yr** — counts as RMD, excludes from AGI\n  [ ] Track combined income vs **$34k/$44k** SS thresholds\n\n**Run withdrawal projections** annually — tools like NewRetirement, Boldin, or a fee-only CFP can model lifetime tax savings of $50k–$300k+.`,
        visual: {
          type: "diagram",
          svg: `<svg viewBox="0 0 1100 1100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="1100" height="1100" fill="#1a1a2e"/><text x="550" y="65" font-family="Arial" font-size="32" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffd700" text-anchor="middle">Decumulation Game Plan by Age</text><rect x="80" y="110" width="940" height="240" rx="16" fill="#0ea5e9" opacity="0.18" stroke="#0ea5e9" stroke-width="3"/><text x="110" y="150" font-family="Arial" font-size="24" font-weight="bold" fill="#0ea5e9">Phase 1: Ages 55–65 (Pre-Retirement)</text><text x="120" y="195" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] Forecast 3-bucket balances at retirement</text><text x="120" y="225" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] Project age-73 RMDs · spot tax torpedo</text><text x="120" y="255" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] If Trad balance &gt; $1M, plan Roth conversion strategy</text><text x="120" y="285" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] Max Roth 401(k) contributions if available</text><text x="120" y="320" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffd700">Goal: shrink the pre-tax pile before RMDs hit</text><rect x="80" y="370" width="940" height="280" rx="16" fill="#10b981" opacity="0.18" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="3"/><text x="110" y="410" font-family="Arial" font-size="24" font-weight="bold" fill="#10b981">Phase 2: Ages 62–72 (Roth Window)</text><text x="120" y="455" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] Delay Social Security to 70 (8%/yr increase)</text><text x="120" y="485" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] Live off taxable brokerage · use HSA at 65</text><text x="120" y="515" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] Each November: convert Trad → Roth to bracket top</text><text x="120" y="545" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] Watch IRMAA thresholds (Medicare premium cliffs)</text><text x="120" y="575" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] Tax-loss harvest in brokerage</text><text x="120" y="615" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffd700">Goal: fill 12%/22% bracket each year, year after year</text><rect x="80" y="670" width="940" height="280" rx="16" fill="#ec4899" opacity="0.18" stroke="#ec4899" stroke-width="3"/><text x="110" y="710" font-family="Arial" font-size="24" font-weight="bold" fill="#ec4899">Phase 3: Age 73+ (RMD Phase)</text><text x="120" y="755" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] Automatic RMDs set up at custodian</text><text x="120" y="785" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] Use QCDs up to $108k/yr (charity excludes from AGI)</text><text x="120" y="815" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] Track SS taxability: combined income vs $34k/$44k</text><text x="120" y="845" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] Roth never RMD-required · let it grow for heirs</text><text x="120" y="875" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" fill="#ffffff">[ ] Step-up basis: hold taxable assets until death</text><text x="120" y="915" font-family="Arial" font-size="18" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffd700">Goal: minimize RMD damage, optimize for legacy</text><text x="550" y="990" font-family="Arial" font-size="20" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffd700" text-anchor="middle">Lifetime tax savings of $50k–$300k+ are realistic.</text></svg>`,
          caption: "Three phases, three playbooks. The middle window is the most overlooked."
        }
      }
