        explanation: "Priya needs to contribute 5% ($6,000) to capture the full 5% match ($6,000). At 3% she's contributing $3,600 and receiving a $3,600 match. To max the match, she needs to add another 2% ($2,400) — and the employer will add a matching $2,400. That's an instant 100% return on the missing $2,400 contribution — the single highest-ROI move available in personal finance.",
